# Version

When you change anything in this game (code, assets, copy, deploy config):

1. Bump `VERSION` in `src/version.js` (semver).
2. Set the same string in `package.json` `"version"`.

Still alpha: keep major at `0`. Patch (`0.y.Z`) for fixes/polish. Minor (`0.Y.0`) for features.

The client shows `v{VERSION}` bottom-right from `src/version.js`.
